[
 {
  "text": "What changes when you tell an",
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 1.97,
  "seg": 0
 },
 {
  "text": "A I note taker no?",
  "start": 2.0,
  "end": 3.94,
  "seg": 0
 },
 {
  "text": "On September second, Tanana Chiefs",
  "start": 4.82,
  "end": 7.45,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Conference, an Interior Alaska",
  "start": 7.48,
  "end": 9.350000000000001,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "tribal health organization, announced",
  "start": 9.38,
  "end": 11.530000000000001,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "it's introducing Sully dot A I.",
  "start": 11.56,
  "end": 13.62,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Its job is paperwork.",
  "start": 14.56,
  "end": 15.6,
  "seg": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "The aim is less typing and",
  "start": 16.24,
  "end": 17.91,
  "seg": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "more attention for patients.",
  "start": 17.94,
  "end": 19.2,
  "seg": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "With the patient's permission,",
  "start": 20.26,
  "end": 21.36,
  "seg": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "the tool listens during the appointment",
  "start": 21.9,
  "end": 23.57,
  "seg": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "and drafts a note.",
  "start": 23.6,
  "end": 24.9,
  "seg": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "That draft still has a boss.",
  "start": 25.6,
  "end": 27.06,
  "seg": 4
 },
 {
  "text": "The provider reviews it, edits",
  "start": 27.7,
  "end": 29.41,
  "seg": 4
 },
 {
  "text": "it, and approves it.",
  "start": 29.44,
  "end": 30.68,
  "seg": 4
 },
 {
  "text": "Only then can it enter the",
  "start": 31.58,
  "end": 33.11,
  "seg": 5
 },
 {
  "text": "medical record.",
  "start": 33.14,
  "end": 33.84,
  "seg": 5
 },
 {
  "text": "Sully isn't making medical decisions.",
  "start": 34.6,
  "end": 36.32,
  "seg": 5
 },
 {
  "text": "But does that design actually give",
  "start": 37.38,
  "end": 39.55,
  "seg": 6
 },
 {
  "text": "patients more attention?",
  "start": 39.58,
  "end": 40.64,
  "seg": 6
 },
 {
  "text": "Keep that question open.",
  "start": 41.52,
  "end": 42.48,
  "seg": 6
 },
 {
  "text": "T C C gives recordings a",
  "start": 43.62,
  "end": 45.15,
  "seg": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "ninety-day deletion policy.",
  "start": 45.18,
  "end": 46.6,
  "seg": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "Recordings and approved notes are",
  "start": 47.32,
  "end": 49.17,
  "seg": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "different things.",
  "start": 49.2,
  "end": 49.900000000000006,
  "seg": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "The technology company may also",
  "start": 50.44,
  "end": 52.53,
  "seg": 8
 },
 {
  "text": "use de-identified portions of recordings",
  "start": 52.56,
  "end": 54.75,
  "seg": 8
 },
 {
  "text": "to improve the system.",
  "start": 54.78,
  "end": 56.16,
  "seg": 8
 },
 {
  "text": "T C C says recording storage",
  "start": 56.92,
  "end": 59.25,
  "seg": 9
 },
 {
  "text": "follows HIPAA.",
  "start": 59.28,
  "end": 60.34,
  "seg": 9
 },
 {
  "text": "Now give the offer its strongest",
  "start": 61.48,
  "end": 63.25,
  "seg": 10
 },
 {
  "text": "case.",
  "start": 63.28,
  "end": 63.980000000000004,
  "seg": 10
 },
 {
  "text": "Less typing could mean a better",
  "start": 64.46,
  "end": 66.15,
  "seg": 10
 },
 {
  "text": "conversation.",
  "start": 66.18,
  "end": 66.88000000000001,
  "seg": 10
 },
 {
  "text": "And T C C tells patients",
  "start": 67.82,
  "end": 69.09,
  "seg": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "about the possible reuse.",
  "start": 69.12,
  "end": 70.4,
  "seg": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "An informed yes is a reasonable",
  "start": 71.12,
  "end": 73.07,
  "seg": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "choice.",
  "start": 73.1,
  "end": 73.8,
  "seg": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "But this notice reports no measured",
  "start": 74.54,
  "end": 76.89,
  "seg": 12
 },
 {
  "text": "benefits.",
  "start": 76.92,
  "end": 77.62,
  "seg": 12
 },
 {
  "text": "A sensible design isn't proof that",
  "start": 78.04,
  "end": 80.03,
  "seg": 12
 },
 {
  "text": "it works.",
  "start": 80.06,
  "end": 80.76,
  "seg": 12
 },
 {
  "text": "One question still matters for",
  "start": 81.44,
  "end": 83.33,
  "seg": 13
 },
 {
  "text": "that informed choice: how long",
  "start": 83.36,
  "end": 85.41,
  "seg": 13
 },
 {
  "text": "can de-identified portions be kept?",
  "start": 85.44,
  "end": 87.22,
  "seg": 13
 },
 {
  "text": "Ask about those portions before",
  "start": 88.38,
  "end": 90.33,
  "seg": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "deciding.",
  "start": 90.36,
  "end": 91.06,
  "seg": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "To decline, just tell your provider.",
  "start": 91.8,
  "end": 93.88,
  "seg": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "Now switch the recorder off.",
  "start": 94.92,
  "end": 96.78,
  "seg": 15
 },
 {
  "text": "T C C says you can",
  "start": 97.56,
  "end": 98.45,
  "seg": 15
 },
 {
  "text": "decline or change your mind.",
  "start": 98.48,
  "end": 100.08,
  "seg": 15
 },
 {
  "text": "Your care won't be affected.",
  "start": 100.64,
  "end": 101.86,
  "seg": 16
 },
 {
  "text": "That's its promise, not an independently",
  "start": 102.58,
  "end": 104.71,
  "seg": 16
 },
 {
  "text": "tested result.",
  "start": 104.74,
  "end": 105.46,
  "seg": 16
 },
 {
  "text": "Useful A I doesn't need every",
  "start": 107.06,
  "end": 109.17,
  "seg": 17
 },
 {
  "text": "patient to make the same choice.",
  "start": 109.2,
  "end": 110.34,
  "seg": 17
 },
 {
  "text": "The machine can step aside.",
  "start": 111.18,
  "end": 112.34,
  "seg": 18
 },
 {
  "text": "The care has to stay.",
  "start": 113.14,
  "end": 114.4,
  "seg": 18
 },
 {
  "text": "Would you want this note taker",
  "start": 115.26,
  "end": 116.75,
  "seg": 19
 },
 {
  "text": "at your next visit?",
  "start": 116.78,
  "end": 117.78,
  "seg": 19
 }
]